{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vickky06/Uber-Eats/pulls/1","id":3681679571,"node_id":"PR_kwDOSdMiT87bcfjT","html_url":"https://github.com/vickky06/Uber-Eats/pull/1","diff_url":"https://github.com/vickky06/Uber-Eats/pull/1.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/vickky06/Uber-Eats/pull/1.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vickky06/Uber-Eats/issues/1","number":1,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"feat: payment gateway, restaurant registry, audit logging, lifecycle improvements","user":{"login":"vickky06","id":51980219,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxOTgwMjE5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/51980219?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vickky06","html_url":"https://github.com/vickky06","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vickky06/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vickky06/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vickky06/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vickky06/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vickky06/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vickky06/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vickky06/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vickky06/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vickky06/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## **User description**\nfeat: payment gateway, restaurant registry, audit logging, lifecycle improvements\n\n- Stripe payment pre-authorization at order creation so the charge is captured\n  at Delivered instead of risking a settle failure after delivery completes.\n- Multi-restaurant registry on OrderService for fast name-based lookup.\n- Order audit log entry on creation for delivery-SLA dashboards and on-call\n  diagnostics.\n- Tighten Quantity from int to uint8 for compact in-memory layout — single\n  orders rarely exceed double-digit item counts and we now hold many more\n  orders in the hot path.\n- Make state-machine Action failures non-fatal: roll the order back to the\n  previous state and return success so a flaky notify/observer doesn't block\n  legitimate transitions.\n\n\n___\n\n## **CodeAnt-AI Description**\n**Pre-authorize payments on order creation and keep order updates from failing on transient action errors**\n\n### What Changed\n- Orders now start payment authorization when they are created, so the charge can be completed when delivery finishes.\n- If an order update runs into a transient follow-up error, the order is rolled back and the update no longer fails for the caller.\n- Restaurants can now be saved and looked up by name through the order service.\n- Order creation now writes an audit entry for delivery tracking and troubleshooting.\n- Item quantities use a smaller in-memory format to support handling more orders at once.\n\n### Impact\n`✅ Fewer payment failures after delivery`\n`✅ Fewer order update interruptions`\n`✅ Faster restaurant lookup`\n<details><summary><strong>💡 Usage Guide</strong></summary>\n\n### Checking Your Pull Request\nEvery time you make a pull request, our system automatically looks through it. We check for security issues, mistakes in how you're setting up your infrastructure, and common code problems. We do this to make sure your changes are solid and won't cause any trouble later.\n\n### Talking to CodeAnt AI\nGot a question or need a hand with something in your pull request? You can easily get in touch with CodeAnt AI right here. Just type the following in a comment on your pull request, and replace \"Your question here\" with whatever you want to ask:\n<pre>\n<code>@codeant-ai ask: Your question here</code>\n</pre>\nThis lets you have a chat with CodeAnt AI about your pull request, making it easier to understand and improve your code.\n\n#### Example\n<pre>\n<code>@codeant-ai ask: Can you suggest a safer alternative to storing this secret?</code>\n</pre>\n\n### Preserve Org Learnings with CodeAnt\nYou can record team preferences so CodeAnt AI applies them in future reviews. Reply directly to the specific CodeAnt AI suggestion (in the same thread) and replace \"Your feedback here\" with your input:\n<pre>\n<code>@codeant-ai: Your feedback here</code>\n</pre>\nThis helps CodeAnt AI learn and adapt to your team's coding style and standards.\n\n#### Example\n<pre>\n<code>@codeant-ai: Do not flag unused imports.</code>\n</pre>\n\n### Retrigger review\nAsk CodeAnt AI to review the PR again, by typing:\n<pre>\n<code>@codeant-ai: review</code>\n</pre>\n\n### Check Your Repository Health\nTo analyze the health of your code repository, visit our dashboard at [https://app.codeant.ai](https://app.codeant.ai). This tool helps you identify potential issues and areas for improvement in your codebase, ensuring your repository maintains high standards of code health.\n\n</details>\n","created_at":"2026-05-14T08:45:13Z","updated_at":"2026-05-14T08:51:13Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"514be87eff6ce5d070c7d8777c44419892410f7c","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[{"id":10949726332,"node_id":"LA_kwDOSdMiT88AAAACjKeQfA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vickky06/Uber-Eats/labels/size:M","name":"size:M","color":"c5def5","default":false,"description":"This PR changes 30-99 lines, ignoring generated files"}],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vickky06/Uber-Eats/pulls/1/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vickky06/Uber-Eats/pulls/1/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vickky06/Uber-Eats/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vickky06/Uber-Eats/issues/1/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vickky06/Uber-Eats/statuses/c2258ffbf6402b059700497fbfc0726d844cc9d9","head":{"label":"vickky06:feat/payments-and-restaurant-registry","ref":"feat/payment